                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is BSC's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Accessible-premium made-to-measure positioning + physical retail + fabric quality + craftsmanship storytelling. Multi-dimensional advantage in premium menswear.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new custom shirt brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific positioning niching (luxury custom, occasion-specific, sustainable fabric focus). Category continues expanding.</p>
                                        <h3>Should custom D2C brands invest in physical retail?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — measurement + fitting + fabric selection compound in physical experience. Digital-only custom D2C has clear limits.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest premium menswear lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Accessible-premium bridges bifurcated markets + physical retail + craftsmanship storytelling combined. Not pure D2C playbook.</p>
